      "text" : "[Striker Unit Commander]",
      "translation" : "[突击小队指挥官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Striker Unit Commander",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@md_name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The field of operation is {0} Check whether the operation was applied properly.",
      "translation" : "行动区域为{0}。请确认行动是否已正确登记。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Striker Unit Commander",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000Goint to the outer boundary of Heart Hunter War Base without clearing the Heart Hunter War Base is prohibited. Also, you cannot enter the Heart Hunter War Base that has already been cleared. Please check your operation point^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000未完成心脏猎人基地任务前，禁止前往基地外围。已经完成攻略的基地也无法进入。请确认你的行动地点。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Striker Unit Commander",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000This is when your progress is different from your party leader of the party member. In this case, find another party member who can go to the same place with you.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000当你的进度与队长或队员不同时会出现此情况。请找一位能与你前往同一地点的队员。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Striker Unit Commander",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000The entry is also impossible if the Memorial Dungeon has not been created as an operation field.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000如果尚未创建作为行动区域的纪念副本，也无法进入。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Striker Unit Commander",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "An unknown error has occurred.",
      "translation" : "发生未知错误。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000If you deal with monsters arbitrarily inside a dungeon, such as Monster taming, it will not be regarded as a normal progress. Please be aware of it.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000在副本内擅自处置怪物（例如驯服怪物）不会被视为正常进度，请注意。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop, which unit are you from? According to your answer, we may have to suppress you using an armed force.",
      "translation" : "站住，你是哪个小队的？根据你的回答，我们可能不得不动用武力制伏你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am executing my mission with the Rebellion unit.",
      "translation" : "我正在和反叛军小队执行任务。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm, you are our troop? Since the scouting is not over yet, don't wander around here carelessly.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你是我们的人？侦察还没结束，不要在这里随意走动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000If you deal with monsters arbitrarily inside a dungeon, such as Monster taming, it will not be regarded as a normal progress. Please be aware of it.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000在副本内擅自处置怪物（例如驯服怪物）不会被视为正常进度，请注意。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you a deserter wandering around without a position?",
      "translation" : "你是个没有编制、到处游荡的逃兵吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000Only the party leader can talk to Julian in detail.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000只有队长才能和朱利安详细交谈。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We are arranging the situation inside the base. You cannot enter yet.",
      "translation" : "我们正在整顿基地内部，你现在还不能进去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffSeems like the base has been arranged inside. ^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff看来基地内部已经整顿完毕。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you the augmentation force in striking Heart Hunter base? I think we met before.",
      "translation" : "你是来袭击心脏猎人基地的增援部队吗？我觉得我们以前见过。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just a thought.",
      "translation" : "只是有这种感觉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it doesn't matter. You should have a rough idea of what's going on here. Just remember that it's not going to be an easy task.",
      "translation" : "算了，这不重要。你应该大致了解这里的情况。记住，这次任务绝不轻松。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Explain the situation to me.",
      "translation" : "给我说明一下情况。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No time, let's proceed now.",
      "translation" : "没时间了，我们现在就出发。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sounds cool. You are like a foreign legion, so stay beside me during the operation.",
      "translation" : "听起来不错。你就像一支外籍军团，行动时跟紧我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm, you haven't received a briefing yet? Since we don't have enough time, let me explain briefly.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你还没收到简报吗？时间不多了，我简单说明一下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We don't have enough forces to strike the base.",
      "translation" : "我们没有足够兵力攻打基地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For the sake of mobility, we abandoned heavy firearms. Since our top priority mission is to occupy the base without destroying it much, most of explosive weapons have been excluded as well.",
      "translation" : "为了提高机动性，我们放弃了重型枪械。首要任务是在不大肆破坏基地的情况下将其占领，因此也排除了大多数爆炸性武器。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If necessary, we can reinforce our firearms using the terrain features in the field... But it must be minimized.",
      "translation" : "必要时，我们可以利用现场地形增强枪械威力...不过必须尽量减少破坏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In any case, most of the operation must be anti-personnel damage and the base facilities have to be maintained whenever possible.",
      "translation" : "总之，行动中主要针对敌方人员造成伤害，并尽可能保留基地设施。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Our advance party has secured the boundary surface in the southern base. We will take that route to move to the central part. And each striker unit will move in an individual route.",
      "translation" : "先遣队已经控制了基地南侧的外围区域。我们会沿那条路线前往中央区域，各突击小队则分别沿不同路线行动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are like a foreign legion, so stay beside me during the operation. Any more question? Of course, I won't take any, even though you have one.",
      "translation" : "你就像一支外籍军团，行动时跟紧我。还有问题吗？当然，就算你有问题，我也没时间回答。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After that, follow the instruction of the chief of your unit. Once the gate to the base is opened, talk to the Striker Unit Commander over there and start.",
      "translation" : "之后听从小队长的指示。基地大门打开后，和那边的突击小队指挥官交谈，然后开始行动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you are ready, I will let you know the attack time.",
      "translation" : "准备好后告诉我，我会通知你进攻时间。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm ready.",
      "translation" : "我准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I need some more time.",
      "translation" : "我还需要一点时间。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I see. Since we are in a hurry, complete your preparation quickly and let me know.",
      "translation" : "知道了。时间紧迫，尽快准备好再告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After that, follow the instruction of the chief of your unit. Once the gate to the base is opened, talk to the Striker Unit Commander over there and start.",
      "translation" : "之后听从小队长的指示。基地大门打开后，和那边的突击小队指挥官交谈，然后开始行动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you been to the toilet? I was looking for you.",
      "translation" : "你去厕所了吗？我刚才一直在找你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
