      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After that, follow the instruction of the chief of your unit. Once the gate to the base is opened, talk to the Striker Unit Commander over there and start.",
      "translation" : "之后听从小队长的指示。基地大门打开后，和那边的突击小队指挥官交谈，然后开始行动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Julian]",
      "translation" : "[朱利安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Julian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a broad vacant land on the outer boundary of the base we have occupied. We built a training ground there, but the facilities are imperfect. I need elite personnel who can examine it.",
      "translation" : "我们占领的基地外围有一大片空地。我们在那里建了训练场，但设施还不完善。我需要精锐人员帮忙检查。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Julian",
